# NFOUZ — Unity + Node/Express repository .gitignore
# Build Recovery Phase — excludes generated/local/secret artifacts only.
# Assets, .meta files, Packages/manifest.json, Packages/packages-lock.json,
# ProjectSettings, backend source, migrations, tests, and documentation
# are intentionally NEVER excluded.

## Unity — generated/local only
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Logs/
UserSettings/
Build/
Builds/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
*.tmp
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
.vs/
.idea/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

## Node / backend — generated/local only
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage/
backend/logs/
dist/

## Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
backend/.env
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json.meta
**/GoogleService-Info.plist.meta
**/google-services-desktop.json
**/google-services-desktop.json.meta
# Generated by the Firebase Unity SDK from google-services.json (holds the
# API key and project identifiers); regenerated on each machine.
**/Plugins/Android/FirebaseApp.androidlib/
**/Plugins/Android/FirebaseApp.androidlib.meta
**/google-services.xml
**/google-services.xml.meta
**/*firebase*service*account*.json
**/*serviceAccountKey*.json
**/PhotonAppSettings.asset.secret
# Photon Fusion stores the App ID here; Mapbox stores the access token here.
**/PhotonAppSettings.asset
**/PhotonAppSettings.asset.meta
**/MapboxConfiguration.txt
**/MapboxConfiguration.txt.meta
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
*.pem
*secret*.json
*credentials*.json

## OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

## Unity — additional generated/local artifacts
*.suo
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.unitypackage
.vscode/
crashlytics-buildid.txt
sysinfo.txt
